  "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/ACINQ/phoenixd/zipball/v0.9.0",
  "body": "## What's Changed\r\n* Disable feature `wake_up_notification_client` by @pm47 in https://github.com/ACINQ/phoenixd/pull/234\r\n* Add support for electrum as blockchain client by @pm47 in https://github.com/ACINQ/phoenixd/pull/235\r\n* Add support for swap-in by @pm47 in https://github.com/ACINQ/phoenixd/pull/236\r\n* Follow-up to #236 by @pm47 in https://github.com/ACINQ/phoenixd/pull/237\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/ACINQ/phoenixd/compare/v0.8.0...v0.9.0\r\n\r\n## Verifying signatures\r\n\r\nYou will need `gpg` and our release signing key `E434ED292E85643A`. Note that you can get it:\r\n- from our website: https://acinq.co/pgp/padioupm.asc\r\n- from github user @pm47: https://api.github.com/users/pm47/gpg_keys\r\n\r\nTo import our signing key:\r\n```\r\n$ gpg --import padioupm.asc\r\n```\r\n\r\nTo verify the release file checksums and signatures:\r\n```\r\n$ gpg -d SHA256SUMS.asc > SHA256SUMS.stripped\r\n$ sha256sum -c SHA256SUMS.stripped\r\n```",
